== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Sulfur|Sulfur]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
** In ''Antibirth'', due to a bug, using Sulfur twice in one room would permanently grant Brimstone to Isaac instead of giving him a more powerful brimstone laser.
* "Sulfur" and "Brimstone" were once synonyms but the word "brimstone" has fallen out of use (outside of biblical usage).
* Sulfur's appearance is based on the [[wikipedia:Alchemical symbol|alchemical symbol]] for sulfur, although the triangle is upside-down and it lacks a small piece separating the cross from the triangle.
* This item has the same pickup quote as {{I|The Nail}}.

